{"term":{"label":"心","occurrences":6,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii","title":"盡心下","description":"孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"充","id":"充"},{"form":"善","id":"善"},{"form":"士","id":"士"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"德","id":"德"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"文","id":"文"},{"form":"昭","id":"昭"},{"form":"欲","id":"欲"},{"form":"殺","id":"殺"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"知","id":"知"},{"form":"至","id":"至"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.7351113796589775,"source":"人","target":"今"},{"weight":1.0917863235977099,"source":"人","target":"殺"},{"weight":1.4282585602189228,"source":"人","target":"昭"},{"weight":1.1405764877671418,"source":"人","target":"充"},{"weight":0.5119678283447677,"source":"人","target":"心"},{"weight":0.580960699831719,"source":"人","target":"欲"},{"weight":1.5824092400461809,"source":"至","target":"心"},{"weight":1.5824092400461809,"source":"至","target":"德"},{"weight":2.2755564206061263,"source":"至","target":"文"},{"weight":1.9390841839849136,"source":"至","target":"王"},{"weight":1.8055527913603908,"source":"至","target":"今"},{"weight":1.4000876832522264,"source":"知","target":"今"},{"weight":1.5336190758767492,"source":"知","target":"殺"},{"weight":1.1769441319380167,"source":"知","target":"文"},{"weight":0.8404718953168039,"source":"知","target":"王"},{"weight":1.9878743481543455,"source":"心","target":"今"},{"weight":1.1769441319380167,"source":"心","target":"子"},{"weight":2.681021528714291,"source":"心","target":"充"},{"weight":2.1214057407788682,"source":"心","target":"欲"},{"weight":1.1769441319380167,"source":"心","target":"善"},{"weight":1.9878743481543455,"source":"充","target":"大"},{"weight":1.6514021115331325,"source":"充","target":"欲"},{"weight":1.4000876832522264,